sequenceDiagram
    participant User as 👤 User
    participant Frontend as Frontend
    participant API as API Server
    participant Auth as Auth Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Redis as Redis Cache
    participant MFA as MFA Service
    
    User->>Frontend: Login (Email + Password)
    Frontend->>API: POST /auth/login
    API->>Auth: Validate Credentials
    Auth->>DB: Query User (Hashed Password)
    DB-->>Auth: User Data
    
    Auth->>Auth: Verify Argon2 Hash
    Auth->>Redis: Check Rate Limit
    Redis-->>Auth: Within Limits
    
    alt MFA Enabled
        Auth->>MFA: Generate TOTP Challenge
        MFA-->>Auth: TOTP Secret
        Auth-->>API: Requires MFA
        API-->>Frontend: MFA Required
        Frontend->>User: Request MFA Code
        User->>Frontend: Enter MFA Code
        Frontend->>API: POST /auth/mfa-verify
        API->>MFA: Verify TOTP Code
        MFA-->>API: Code Valid
    end
    
    Auth->>Auth: Generate JWT Tokens
    Auth->>DB: Store Refresh Token
    Auth->>Redis: Cache Session
    Auth-->>API: Access + Refresh Tokens
    API-->>Frontend: Tokens + User Data
    Frontend->>Frontend: Store Tokens (Secure)
    
    Note over Frontend,Redis: Subsequent Requests
    Frontend->>API: Request with JWT
    API->>Auth: Validate JWT
    Auth->>Redis: Check Token Blacklist
    Redis-->>Auth: Token Valid
    Auth->>DB: Check User Permissions
    DB-->>Auth: Role & Permissions
    Auth-->>API: Authorized
    API-->>Frontend: Protected Resource
